SUMMARY:Board Game Night - Panera Bread 
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nJoin us f
 or a board game event! Please bring your favorite board games to the event
 ! We can play games like chess\, parcheesi\, etc\n\nWe will be meeting at 
 Panera in Paramus\, NJ!\n\nPanera sells coffee \, drinks\, baked goods\, f
 oods\, etc.\, that you can have at the event.\n\nIf you are not feeling we
 ll\, please do not attend our event.Thank you!\n\nNOTE: If you are not att
 ending the event\, please change your RSVP accordingly.
