 l/events/314698886/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260509T134830Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260509T134830Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_314930862@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260611T043713Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260613T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260613T160000
SUMMARY:Casual Volleyball - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nWe're a g
 roup of people who will start by hitting the ball around for the first 20-
 30 minutes and then will break up into 2-4 teams for two or three hours of
  play.\n\nIf we have more than 20 people show up\, we'll break up into thr
 ee or four teams of 6 (Some may have 7\, 8 or 9. Additional players just r
 otate into play). Games will be to 10 points. Rally scoring. Winner stays 
 on (unless a team has won four straight).\n\nWe'll be heading outdoors to 
 the hard court in Leonia off Overpeck County Pk Driveway in the Overpeck C
 ounty Park.\n\n\\*\\*\\ \\*After playing\, we'll be likely heading to Trop
 ical Juice Bar\, an idea of regular attendee Kate\, for a drink and snack.
  It's located at 60 River St. in Hackensack. Feel free to join us or sugge
 st another spot for a post-volleyball hangout. \\*\\*\\*\n\nThere's no fee
  to play volleyball and nothing else you need to do besides show up. Come 
 anytime!! All are welcome!!! We're not in a league and are not here to ana
 lyze your form. We're more for people who haven't played in months\, maybe
  years\, and just want to occasionally play again and hang out.\n\nDirecti
 ons: You can Google "Volleyball Court in Leonia" and it should come up. Or
  type 41 Willow Tree Road\, Leonia\, NJ 07605 into your GPS\, but note tha
 t it's not on Willow Tree Road\, just near it. Instead\, turn onto Overpec
 k County Pk Driveway off Fort Lee Road (Degraw Avenue). It is past the ten
 nis courts and near a basketball court and track. You can try Googling Leo
 nia High School as well. That should help you find it.\n\nWe don't have th
 e court reserved and if it happens to be taken\, we may play with those al
 ready occupying it or we will try to relocate on the fly. It's certainly p
 ossible that we may have to cancel that day if we can't find a suitable sp
 ot. Please keep that in mind. And if it's looking like it'll rain or snow\
 , I'll make a call on whether to cancel around an hour ahead of time.\n\nP
 lease bring a ball and net if you have them for possible use during the ga
 me. Feel free to bring a speaker for music\, or snacks and drinks for cons
 umption during play.\n\nIf you have trouble finding the court or group\, y
 ou can call or text Andy Milone at 201-234-9609. There is plenty of parkin
 g and an open bathroom at the park.\n\nHope you'll join us for our 19th of
 ficial volleyball event. Questions or comments? You can message Andy on Me
 etup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609. Check out bowling\, soccer\, voll
 eyball\, tennis or one of our other activities at: www.meetup.com/north-je
 rsey-bowling-soccer-volleyball\n\nIf interested in staying touch with grou
 p members or conversing about future events\, feel free to inquire about o
 ur WhatsApp group chat.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314930862/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260524T040419Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260524T040419Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
