SUMMARY:Food Truck Fest - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nIt is foo
 d truck festival time.\n\nJoin us at JC’s Annual Montvale “Mile Long
 ” Street Fair & Food Truck Fest.\n\n1 p.m. June 14.\n\n101 Paragon Drive
  Montvale NJ 07645\n\nThe event comes to you courtesy of our WhatsApp grou
 p chat and Jackie\, one of our event regulars.\n\nWe'll share more details
  as we get closer to the date.\n\nHere are some event links:\n\nhttps://jc
 promotions.info/product/jcs-annual-montvale-mile-long-street-fair-food-tru
 ck-fest/\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/837384746049259\n\nQuestions o
 r comments? You can message Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9
 609. Check out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis or one of our other 
 activities at: www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball\n\nIf
  interested in staying touch with group members or conversing about future
  events\, feel free to inquire about our WhatsApp group chat.
