SUMMARY:BVT goes to Mitsuwa!
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nYou read 
 it right!\n\nBVT goes to Mitsuwa!\nAs with traditional work weeks\, people
  might usually feel like there's a mountain climb to reach Friday\, or in 
 most cases at least Thursday.\n\nThis time around\, BVT will look to make 
 everyone's work week that much more less of a drag with a nuanced event ce
 ntered around Japanese culture\, food\, and much more.
